      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. On boot the host firmware publishes its BIOS configuration to the BMC. It is stored in the BaseBIOSTable property of xyz.openbmc_project.BIOSConfig.Manager (bios-settings-mgr), one entry per attribute.\n \n▎ 2. On GET Bios, bmcweb reads that table and converts each entry\u0027s current value to JSON by its type: Enumeration/String/Password → string, Integer → number, Boolean → boolean. Each entry becomes one property under Attributes, for example \"DisableSmt\": false.",
